{"schema_version": 2, "timestamp": 1788447456.8036175, "file": "experiment/lambda_self_2group (failed)", "file_hash": "00000000000000000000000000000000", "prev_hash": "400915a729ef90a7986c5c2c0da65577", "event_type": "experiment_failed", "status": "failed", "experiment": "lambda_self_2group", "conclusion": "Lambda-Self 实验失败：lambda_self 在整个 1000 tick 中恒为 0。原因：Van der Pol 振荡器 + 压力缓冲使系统自然产生大幅度振荡（mode 切换 168 次），rigidity = 1 - tok_range/350 始终为 0（tok_range ~ 140+），因此 lambda_raw 始终为 0，modulator 始终为 1.0。ALPHA=1.5 实验组与 ALPHA=0 对照组在所有指标上完全相同（方差 1860.19，切换 168 次，mode 分布一致）", "criteria": {"variance_exp_gt_ctrl": false, "switches_exp_gt_ctrl": false, "lambda_causal_evidence": false, "control_rigid": false}, "summary": {"exp_var": 1860.19, "ctrl_var": 1860.19, "exp_switches": 168, "ctrl_switches": 168, "lambda_mean": 0.0, "lambda_max": 0.0, "token_range_mean": "~140"}, "honest_note": "Lambda-Self 机制本身正确实现了设计公式，但在当前系统参数下永远无法激活（因为系统自然振荡导致 rigidity 恒为 0）。实验失败源于设计前提错误：期望检测到僵化，但系统根本不会僵化。", "record_hash": "0233618df03dc7a3ebb10aaf0e58b75b"}
